  "title": "Hunan-Style Chicken",
  "description": "This easy chicken dish is flavored with honey, sherry, soy sauce, and Chinese bean sauce, along with fresh ginger, garlic, and scallions. Chopped dried chiles give it spice.",
  "authors": [
    "Dan"
  ],
